.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH lint 1  "lint " 
.SH NAME
lint \- Lint a snippet (danger lints + secret scan) without running anything. Exit 0 clean, 1 warnings, 2 blocking
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlint\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lint a snippet (danger lints + secret scan) without running anything. Exit 0 clean, 1 warnings, 2 blocking
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Snippet name
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg lint ubuntu\-setup
